<title>FRANCE: French Feb official reserves 306.39 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>French Feb official reserves 306.39 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of France and finance ministry gave the following breakdown of offical gold and foreign exchange reserves (in billions of francs)</p>
<p>					  Feb    Jan</p>
<p> Total reserves		   306.394  302.417</p>
<p> Gold				 159.521  159.521</p>
<p> Ecu				   51.078   51.078</p>
<p> Foreign exchange		  76.931   72.975</p>
<p> Credits with IMF		  18.864   18.843</p>
